    "overview": "The Ant Esports AEC610 is a 6-in-1 USB-C hub combining a USB 3.0 port, two USB 2.0 ports and an SD/Micro SD card reader in one compact splitter, adding a full set of essential connections to any modern USB-C laptop or MacBook. VGA output supports 1080p@60Hz while HDMI covers up to 4K@30Hz, letting you connect a high-quality monitor, TV or projector for presentations or media. OTG compatibility extends its usefulness to a wider range of devices, and true plug-and-play operation means no drivers are needed on Windows, MacBook or Notebook systems. A compact, portable build makes it easy to carry the AEC610 in a laptop bag for everyday multiport expansion on the go.",
